      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=15)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=13)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=8)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-1,label=-1,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Perception rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Perception Check), Stealth rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Stealth Check), Survival rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Survival Check)  
      **Senses** darkvision 60 ft., Passive Perception 13  
      **Languages** -  
      **Challenge** 2 (450 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Traits

      ***Spider Climb.*** The ettercap can climb difficult surfaces, including along ceilings, without needing to make an ability check.

      ***Web Walker.*** The ettercap ignores movement restrictions caused by webs, and the ettercap knows the location of any other creature in contact with the same web.

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The ettercap makes one Bite attack and one Claw attack.

      ***Bite.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=To Hit [Bite]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d6+2,dicelabel=Damage [Bite]) Piercing damage plus rollable(dice=1d4,dicelabel=Damage [Bite]) Poison damage, and the target has the ***Poisoned*** condition until the start of the ettercap's next turn.

      ***Claw.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=To Hit [Claw]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d4+2,dicelabel=Damage [Claw]) Slashing damage.

      ***Web Strand (rollable(dice=1d6,label=Recharge 5-6,dicelabel=Recharge [Web Strand])).*** *Dexterity Saving Throw:* DC 12, one Large or smaller creature the ettercap can see within 30 feet. *Failure:* The target has the ***Restrained*** condition until the web is destroyed (AC 10; HP 5; ***Vulnerability*** to Fire damage; ***Immunity*** to Bludgeoning, Poison, and Psychic damage).

      ## Bonus Actions

      ***Reel.*** The ettercap pulls one creature within 30 feet of itself that is ***Restrained*** by its Web Strand up to 25 feet straight toward itself.

